 * Auxiliary Constructions:
: Points


 * Proof steps:
001. F,E,G are collinear [06] & BD ∥ AC [00] & EF ∥ AC [04] ⇒  EG ∥ BD [08]
002. EG ∥ BD [08] & E,A,B are collinear [01] & D,A,G are collinear [07] ⇒  AB:EA = DB:EG [09]
003. EF ∥ AC [04] & C,F,B are collinear [05] & E,A,B are collinear [01] ⇒  CB:CF = AB:EA [10]
004. BD ∥ AC [00] & EF ∥ AC [04] ⇒  FE ∥ BD [11]
005. FE ∥ BD [11] & C,F,B are collinear [05] & D,C,E are collinear [02] ⇒  CB:CF = DB:FE [12]
006. AB:EA = DB:EG [09] & CB:CF = AB:EA [10] & CB:CF = DB:FE [12] ⇒  DB:FE = DB:EG [13]
007. DB:FE = DB:EG [13] & DB:DE = DB:DE [03] ⇒  FE = EG
